  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">Hi all，</span><br style=\"\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">【琉璃幻境】活动将于3.30日进入测试阶段，现申请相关资源及礼物配置。</span><br style=\"\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">辛苦@叶导 审批，&nbsp;</span><br style=\"\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">辛苦@灿灿配置并返回相关id。</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">资源需求</span></p><table><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 77.75pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 116.8pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 48.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 84.45pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 48.0pt;\" /> </colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>类型</td><td>资源名称</td><td>资源id</td><td>url</td><td>备注</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>座驾</td><td>财神爷进房座驾</td><td>4737</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwNjA4MjAzNjA2NSMgMjAjcG5n.png\" href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwNjA4MjAzNjA2NSMgMjAjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwNjA4MjAzNjA2NSMgMjAjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>资料卡浮屏</td><td>琉璃执星资料卡浮屏</td><td>2934</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY1Mzg5NzAyNDYzMCM4NjAjcG5n.png\" title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY1Mzg5NzAyNDYzMCM4NjAjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY1Mzg5NzAyNDYzMCM4NjAjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>主页挂件</td><td>幻境逐光<span class=\"font0\">主页挂件</span></td><td>6993</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0MjM1MjEzNDQ0NSM2OTkjcG5n.png\" href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0MjM1MjEzNDQ0NSM2OTkjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0MjM1MjEzNDQ0NSM2OTkjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>头像框</td><td>琉璃筑梦头像框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>头像框</td><td>幻境逐光<span class=\"font0\">头像框</span></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>头像框</td><td>幻境月主动态头像框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>头像框</td><td>琉璃执星动态头像框</td><td>6841</td><td><a href=\"https://m4a.inke.cn/MTc0MDk4MzkwODYzMiM2MzUjd2VicA==.webp\">https://m4a.inke.cn/MTc0MDk4MzkwODYzMiM2MzUjd2VicA==.webp</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>送礼托盘</td><td>幻境逐光<span class=\"font0\">送礼托盘</span></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>热门卡</td><td>热13推荐卡</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>7天*10min</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>麦序框</td><td>琉璃筑梦<span class=\"font0\">麦序框</span></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>麦序框</td><td>幻境逐光<span class=\"font0\">麦序框</span></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>麦序框</td><td>幻境月主动态麦序框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>进房座驾</td><td>幻境逐光<span class=\"font0\">进房座驾</span></td><td>7579</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NzM3ODA3Mjg0OCM0MTAjcG5n.png\" href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NzM3ODA3Mjg0OCM0MTAjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NzM3ODA3Mjg0OCM0MTAjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>观众席底纹</td><td>幻境逐光<span class=\"font0\">观众席底纹</span></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>挂件</td><td>琉璃筑梦<span class=\"font0\">主页挂件</span></td><td>7228</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcxNzY3MDQyNDg0OSM4MjYjcG5n.png\" href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcxNzY3MDQyNDg0OSM4MjYjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcxNzY3MDQyNDg0OSM4MjYjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>挂件</td><td>琉璃执星挂件</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>挂件</td><td>琉璃执星浮屏</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>挂件</td><td>幻境月主<span class=\"font1\">主页挂件</span></td><td>5539</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcyMTE4NjY3MTcyMCMzMjcjcG5n.png\" href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcyMTE4NjY3MTcyMCMzMjcjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcyMTE4NjY3MTcyMCMzMjcjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>挂件</td><td>幻境月主<span class=\"font1\">主页浮屏</span></td><td>5122</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/